            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "I will give thanks to You with an upright heart,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.7"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q",
          "vid": "PSA 119:7"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "When I learn [through discipline] Your righteous judgments [for my transgressions].",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.7"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "PSA 119:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "I shall keep Your statutes;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.8"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q",
          "vid": "PSA 119:8"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Do not utterly abandon me [when I fail].",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.8"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "qa"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Beth.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.8"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "PSA 119:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "¶How can a young man keep his way pure?",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.9"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q",
          "vid": "PSA 119:9"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "By keeping watch [on himself] according to Your word [conforming his life to Your precepts].",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.9"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "PSA 119:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "With all my heart I have sought You, [inquiring of You and longing for You];",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.10"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q",
          "vid": "PSA 119:10"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Do not let me wander from Your commandments [neither through ignorance nor by willful disobedience]. [2 Chr 15:15]",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "PSA.119.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "PSA.119.10"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
